# PROVENANCE: Synthetic regression for protected ChangeKeySettings in an EV2 session.
name: EV2 ChangeKeySettings requires valid full protection
case-id: ev2-change-key-settings-requires-full-protection
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: generated protected ChangeKeySettings regression
issues: https://github.com/cindersocket/dfc-core/issues/125
